your own heart on your bed, and be still. Selah.","poem":2}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"text":"Offer the sacrifices of righteousness.","poem":1},{"text":"Put your trust in Yahweh.","poem":2}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"text":"Many say, “Who will show us any good?”","poem":1},{"text":"Yahweh, let the light of your face shine on us.","poem":2}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"text":"You have put gladness in my heart,","poem":1},{"text":"more than when their grain and their new wine are increased.","poem":2}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"text":"In peace I will both lay myself down and sleep,","poem":1},{"text":"for you alone, Yahweh, make me live in safety.","poem":2}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/eng_web/PSA/4.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/eng_web/PSA/5.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/eng_web/PSA/3.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":8}